---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About | Lathrem Homebuilders"
  description="Lathrem Homebuilders is a licensed Arizona general contractor in Tucson, building custom homes, remodels and outdoor living on a standard of honesty, accountability and craftsmanship."
  canonical="/about.html"
>
  <!-- ================= PAGE HEAD ================= -->
  <section class="pagehead">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">About us</p>
      <h1 class="display h-xl">We are not your typical construction company.</h1>
      <p class="lede" style="max-width:58ch;margin-top:26px">Lathrem Homebuilders is a licensed Arizona general contractor based in Tucson, building custom homes, remodels and outdoor living throughout Pima County.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= STORY ================= -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="split split--top">
        <div class="rv">
          <Photo src="dc-elevation.jpg" alt="Stacked-stone piers and a curved stucco wall at the entrance to a custom desert home" />
        </div>
        <div class="rv rv-d1">
          <p class="eyebrow">Our approach</p>
          <h2 class="display h-md" style="margin-bottom:24px">Decades of experience, and a quest to keep improving.</h2>
          <p class="lede">We are passionate about building and committed to delivering on our promises. Experience across every phase of the construction process, combined with practical knowledge and a genuine appreciation for a wide variety of design styles, is what lets us deliver remarkable results.</p>
          <p class="lede">We believe that truly superior homes are built by people of high character, whose values are marked by honesty, accountability, and a dedication to doing things right the first time. Based on those principles, our goal is simple: create long-term relationships, treat every project as if it were our own, and stand behind everything we say and do.</p>
          <p class="lede">Charles Lathrem still keeps an eye on houses this company finished years ago. That is the measure we hold ourselves to.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= PRINCIPLES ================= -->
  <section class="section section--warm">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid-head rv">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">What we hold to</p>
          <h2 class="display h-lg">Six things we won't trade away.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="svc">
        <div class="svc__i rv">
          <div class="svc__n">01</div>
          <h3>Honesty</h3>
          <p>Straight answers about cost, schedule and what is actually possible on your site, including when the answer is one you would rather not hear.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="svc__i rv rv-d1">
          <div class="svc__n">02</div>
          <h3>Accountability</h3>
          <p>We own the outcome. If something isn't right, we fix it, during construction and long after the final walkthrough.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="svc__i rv rv-d2">
          <div class="svc__n">03</div>
          <h3>Craftsmanship</h3>
          <p>Doing it right the first time. The details you notice on the tenth visit are the ones we spend the most time on.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="svc" style="margin-top:clamp(28px,3.4vw,56px)">
        <div class="svc__i rv">
          <div class="svc__n">04</div>
          <h3>Communication</h3>
          <p>Transparent budgets, regular updates and a builder who picks up the phone. Most construction problems are really communication problems.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="svc__i rv rv-d1">
          <div class="svc__n">05</div>
          <h3>Continual improvement</h3>
          <p>Decades in, we still change how we build. New materials, better systems and a commitment to personal and technological development keep our work current.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="svc__i rv rv-d2">
          <div class="svc__n">06</div>
          <h3>Relationships</h3>
          <p>We would rather build three houses for one family over twenty years than thirty for people we never hear from again.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= RECOGNITION ================= -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid-head rv">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Recognition</p>
          <h2 class="display h-lg" style="max-width:18ch">Awarded for the parts you can't see.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="awards rv rv-d1">
        <div class="award">
          <div class="award__n">Most Innovative Outdoor Living</div>
          <div class="award__b">Parade of Homes</div>
        </div>
        <div class="award">
          <div class="award__n">Most Energy Efficient Home</div>
          <div class="award__b">Parade of Homes &middot; Energy Star</div>
        </div>
        <div class="award">
          <div class="award__n">Most Energy Efficient Custom Home in Southern Arizona</div>
          <div class="award__b">U.S. EPA Energy Star &middot; City of Tucson</div>
        </div>
        <div class="award">
          <div class="award__n">Home Energy Efficiency Award</div>
          <div class="award__b">City of Tucson &middot; Honorary Mention</div>
        </div>
        <div class="award">
          <div class="award__n">Civano Health House</div>
          <div class="award__b">American Lung Association</div>
          <div class="award__note">Volunteer building partner.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="award">
          <div class="award__n">America's Finest Homes</div>
          <div class="award__b">Frontgate magazine</div>
          <div class="award__note">A Lathrem-built residence, featured June 2008.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="small rv" style="margin-top:26px">
        Energy efficiency has been a priority here since long before it was fashionable.
        Four of the six recognitions above are for how these houses perform, not how they look.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= CREDENTIALS ================= -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="split split--top">
        <div class="rv">
          <p class="eyebrow">Credentials</p>
          <h2 class="display h-md" style="margin-bottom:28px">Licensed, bonded and on the public record.</h2>
          <p class="lede">Every claim below can be checked. Our licenses are filed with the Arizona Registrar of Contractors and are a matter of public record.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rv rv-d1">
          <dl class="deflist">
            <div><dt>Company</dt><dd>Lathrem Homebuilders, LLC</dd></div>
            <div><dt>License</dt><dd>Arizona ROC #324057. General Dual, active. Twenty-one further Arizona licenses held.</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Standing</dt><dd>BuildZoom score of 120, above 99% of 71,576 licensed Arizona contractors.</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Client rating</dt><dd>5.0 out of 5 across 19 reviews on Houzz.</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Office</dt><dd>4032 W Moore Rd, Tucson, AZ 85742</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Telephone</dt><dd><a href="tel:+15209750456">(520) 975-0456</a></dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= SERVICES / AREAS ================= -->
  <section class="section section--warm">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="split">
        <div class="rv">
          <p class="eyebrow">What we build</p>
          <h2 class="display h-md" style="margin-bottom:28px">From a new kitchen to a house on a bare lot.</h2>
          <dl class="deflist">
            <div><dt>New construction</dt><dd>Custom homes, energy-efficient and green building</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Renovation</dt><dd>Whole-home remodels, kitchens and baths</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Additions</dt><dd>Home additions, extensions and guest houses</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Exterior</dt><dd>Outdoor living areas, ramadas, custom pools and spas</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <div class="rv rv-d1">
          <Photo src="tr-loggia.jpg" alt="Timber loggia with an outdoor dining table looking across the desert" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= TESTIMONIAL ================= -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="quote rv">
        <hr class="rule rule--center">
        <blockquote>&ldquo;Lathrem Homebuilders is a different type of builder. Not only did we get a quality home from Lathrem, but we enjoy the added benefit of a builder relationship that has served us long beyond the life of the construction process.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <cite>Alan &amp; Desiree Davis &middot; Homeowners</cite>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= CTA ================= -->
  <section class="cta">
    <div class="cta__media"><Photo src="dc-patio-dusk.jpg" alt="" /></div>
    <div class="cta__inner rv">
      <h2 class="display h-lg">Let's talk about your project.</h2>
      <p>Whether it is a new build, a remodel or an outdoor room you have been putting off, the first conversation costs nothing.</p>
      <div class="cta__btns">
        <a class="btn btn--onDark" href="/contact.html">Get in touch</a>
        <a class="btn btn--outline" href="/portfolio.html">See the portfolio</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
